                <invention-title lang="de">SIGNALISIERUNG VON REFERENZSIGNALORTEN IN SCHLITZEN UND MINISCHLITZEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SIGNALISATION D'EMPLACEMENTS DE SIGNAUX DE RÉFÉRENCE DANS DES CRÉNEAUX ET DES MINI-CRÉNEAUX</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SIGNALING REFERENCE SIGNAL LOCATIONS IN SLOTS AND MINI-SLOTS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>According to some embodiments, a method for use in a wireless transmitter of a wireless communication network comprises providing control information relating to a slot. The control information includes an indication of whether the slot is of a first type or a second type. A slot of the first type starts at a slot interval boundary, and a slot of the second type either starts between slot interval boundaries and has arbitrary length or starts at a slot interval boundary and has reduced length. The control information includes an implicit or explicit reference signal timing indication if the slot is of the second type. The method further comprises transmitting the control information to a wireless receiver.</p>
            </abstract>
